# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Repository root. Per-project ignores live in api/.gitignore and
# web/.gitignore — this file only covers things at the top level.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Delivery archives — these are duplicated source, never commit them
*.zip

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# Local scratch
/tmp/
/_to_delete/
*.local

# Claude Code session artifacts
.claude/

# Throwaway browser probes. They are written to verify one change and are
# not maintained afterwards; four have reached a commit by way of `git add -A`.
# Both spellings, because the convention has drifted between them and the
# pattern that only covers one is the pattern that misses the next one.
_*.mjs
probe-*.mjs
_*.py
# And PHP, which is the spelling that got past this the fifth time: the popup
# module's probes are artisan-bootstrapping scripts rather than browser ones,
# so they were `api/scripts/_*.php` and this list covered neither.
# `seed-chat-stress.php` is tracked deliberately and carries no underscore —
# it is a maintained fixture that `docs/` points at, not a throwaway.
_*.php

# Probe files from scripted testing — one of these held a live bearer token.
.tok
.pg
